Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.91,0:00:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：最强的决斗者们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.54,0:00:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}展开激战{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.74,0:00:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界决斗嘉年华！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.52,0:00:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要进入决赛 就得集齐5个心之碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须完成才行。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.65,0:00:11.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的心之碎片已经集齐4个了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.70,0:00:13.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定要进决赛！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.11,0:00:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）勇敢的决斗者们！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在此刻决斗嘉年华第二天正式结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.29,0:00:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之碎片争夺战 明天就是最后一天。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战士们啊 暂且收起羽翼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.19,0:00:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}养精蓄锐迎接明天吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.68,0:00:33.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之振奋！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）快斗大人 您以光子模式
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.02,0:00:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行 No.狩猎的次数太多了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.68,0:00:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去 快斗大人的身体会……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.59,0:00:45.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）不用你多操心。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.88,0:00:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你给我闭嘴去收集 No.的情报就行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.81,0:00:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是……遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.27,0:00:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）哈鲁特。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.44,0:01:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？身体还好吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.75,0:01:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（哈鲁特）哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.07,0:01:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Numbers正在一步步收集齐全。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.81,0:01:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快了……很快
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.55,0:01:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能治好你的病了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.37,0:01:16.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再忍耐一下就好。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.26,0:01:19.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.06,0:01:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.34,0:01:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事。没什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.36,0:01:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我得走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.08,0:01:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么啊，那是什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.99,0:02:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（大家）哦哦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.55,0:02:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）可是啊，都那样给你加油打气了，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.41,0:02:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这点东西请一下客也没什么吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.96,0:02:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话虽这么说……真是的，会胖的哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.59,0:02:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.73,0:02:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有 什么都没……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.99,0:02:28.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（喇叭声）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.92,0:02:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么情况！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.31,0:02:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那孩子 危险！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.39,0:02:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…… 那家伙是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.21,0:02:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗的弟弟！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.42,0:02:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.34,0:02:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！ 你这家伙 在干什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.35,0:02:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（喇叭声）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.78,0:02:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.31,0:04:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:43.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.66,0:04:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.78,0:04:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…… 咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.94,0:04:50.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）游马 你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.24,0:04:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:04:58.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这是啥啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.28,0:05:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底 发生什么事了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.12,0:05:08.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕 是在激烈冲突的瞬间某种力量产生{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}空间本身被弹飞了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.55,0:05:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个少年 到底……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.87,0:05:18.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不冷吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.77,0:05:19.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.26,0:05:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 难道 这家伙是……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.35,0:05:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你能看见我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.45,0:05:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么？ 你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.15,0:05:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等 真的假的！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.53,0:05:35.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还能说话吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.57,0:05:38.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的名字是 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.00,0:05:39.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.38,0:05:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.56,0:05:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 认识我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:05:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马！ 你没事吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.50,0:06:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.87,0:06:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这不是很不妙吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.13,0:06:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.52,0:06:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.93,0:06:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.49,0:06:09.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我有事想问这孩子。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.20,0:06:12.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你这么说啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:16.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊～ 哎呀！ 没办法了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.92,0:06:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游、游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.24,0:06:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂、喂！ 我的车！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（戈什）啊～啊给我开了这么大一个洞{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.13,0:06:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还真是相当大胆的风格呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.72,0:06:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德罗瓦）你在说什么悠哉的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.05,0:06:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德罗瓦）这事要是传到心园先生耳朵里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.01,0:06:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的话……。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.16,0:06:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（戈什）呵 是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.97,0:06:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就封口吧 对快斗也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是让人知道哈鲁失踪了那家伙闹起来可太可怕了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.97,0:06:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.99,0:06:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天傍晚 东城区 C区
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.75,0:06:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3562号十字路口{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.93,0:06:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发生了一起拖车侧翻的事故。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.21,0:06:59.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！居然闹成
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.84,0:07:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么大的新闻了嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:07.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么把我给带过来了啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.01,0:07:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马 别闹了 游马 别闹了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.40,0:07:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是 从哪里来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.25,0:07:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么你会认识我？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.78,0:07:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐 为什么你不觉得冷呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.06,0:07:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.96,0:07:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}饭做好啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.46,0:07:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）你也稍微来帮帮忙啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.71,0:07:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！从决斗炸鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.61,0:07:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到决斗烧 再到决斗汤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.05,0:07:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有决斗土豆炖肉！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.92,0:07:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看起来好好吃～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.33,0:07:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.80,0:07:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先说「我开动了」啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.99,0:07:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（春）就是 在客人面前这么没规矩。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.02,0:07:43.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}知道了啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.51,0:07:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多吃点啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.21,0:07:48.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我们就开吃吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.23,0:07:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（大家）我开动啦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.72,0:08:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奶奶 这个土豆炖肉好好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.64,0:08:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}尽管多吃点啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.70,0:08:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？你不吃吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不饿吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.87,0:08:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用客气尽管吃就行。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你给我稍微客气一点。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:15.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么嘛～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.37,0:08:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）干嘛啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.46,0:08:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.24,0:08:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？好吃吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.05,0:08:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是因为这样大家一起吃才好吃啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.58,0:08:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特 再来一碗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.80,0:08:52.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再来一碗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.37,0:08:59.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听好了，要是找到那小子就通知我。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.62,0:09:03.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是敢随便动手就会变得跟那个洞一样哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.61,0:09:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）可是，那孩子到底
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.43,0:09:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是想去哪里呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.40,0:09:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知道啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.18,0:09:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想联系快斗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.56,0:09:16.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也不知道那家伙在哪儿。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.27,0:09:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗啊，要是见到那个人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.13,0:09:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，说不定就得
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.43,0:09:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟他决斗了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.36,0:09:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是输了的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.16,0:09:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛，到时候再说吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.09,0:09:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.79,0:09:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.66,0:09:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我有好多事想问他……想问遥人。很多很多。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.22,0:09:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕关于我的他知道些什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.70,0:09:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.15,0:09:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算了 总之明天那家伙……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.81,0:09:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（声响）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.18,0:10:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.32,0:10:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特。哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.37,0:10:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着我 哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.85,0:10:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.65,0:10:29.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶。哈鲁特那家伙跑哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.99,0:10:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道又像刚才那样 遇到事故……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.77,0:10:33.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是那个。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.54,0:10:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.41,0:10:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（车辆撞击声）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.88,0:10:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这边。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.91,0:10:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.23,0:10:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（嘈杂声）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.80,0:10:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.97,0:10:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发生什么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.80,0:10:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是 哈鲁特……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.80,0:10:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.73,0:11:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那这附近应该还……啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.17,0:11:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}春人。找到～了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.86,0:11:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}春人。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.62,0:11:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，等等。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.75,0:11:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你打算去哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.29,0:11:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我必须去。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.80,0:11:22.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去？去哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.07,0:11:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去那个地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥他……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.08,0:11:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在找快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.53,0:11:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道了。我明天一定把你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.39,0:11:37.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}带到快斗那里我会带你去的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.15,0:11:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以今天……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.36,0:11:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.37,0:11:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔，小鸟快躲开！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.89,0:11:45.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.27,0:11:58.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}春人。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.36,0:12:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（牛尾）哦～来了来了，来～了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.91,0:12:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有反应了。B的12区块。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.17,0:12:08.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确定没错吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.59,0:12:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，空间内质量的变化可不是闹着玩的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.13,0:12:14.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那小子用了力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.19,0:12:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}势头不错嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.92,0:12:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.13,0:12:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然是在朝着快斗那家伙在的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.61,0:12:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前进吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.58,0:12:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，也许吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.32,0:12:38.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.15,0:12:43.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（高修）找到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.88,0:12:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧小子，夜间散步结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.96,0:12:51.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？你们几个！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.47,0:12:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你……到底有什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.75,0:12:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那得看这边的兴致了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.42,0:12:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么你们会和哈鲁特在一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.34,0:13:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那当然是所谓一宿一饭的……什么来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.62,0:13:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给了他一顿款待啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.74,0:13:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么莫名其妙的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.43,0:13:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，小子，回家去。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.29,0:13:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回家？回哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.33,0:13:16.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你到底跟哈鲁特是什么关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.78,0:13:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟你们没关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.64,0:13:20.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好了，走吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.98,0:13:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.51,0:13:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，等一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.59,0:13:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特不是不愿意吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.65,0:13:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个烦人的小鬼。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.45,0:13:42.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙的归宿只有心园。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.29,0:13:50.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，回去吧。回心园。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.28,0:13:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别妨碍我。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？空间内质量大幅上升。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快逃，戈修！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.44,0:14:06.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.58,0:14:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…控制不住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.35,0:14:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德罗瓦！唔哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.23,0:14:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈修，你没事吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.26,0:14:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.41,0:14:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.84,0:14:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道了，春人。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.65,0:14:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你想去快斗那里的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.90,0:14:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定带你去。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.17,0:14:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那小子跟一群初中生小鬼在一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.72,0:14:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听好了，一定要找出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.60,0:14:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马那混蛋……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.88,0:15:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥……哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.10,0:15:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗就在这座塔上面吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，如果快斗在的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.72,0:15:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.88,0:15:34.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗根本不在啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.57,0:15:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪里？在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.47,0:15:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有……没有……找不到。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.79,0:15:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，春人。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.56,0:15:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找不到啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.03,0:15:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么叫找不到啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.87,0:15:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不是来找快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.16,0:15:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来找哥哥的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.85,0:15:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是方方的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.14,0:15:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小小的，甜甜的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.07,0:15:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}方方的？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.06,0:15:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有那个的话，哥哥就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.60,0:16:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.60,0:16:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.11,0:16:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……这道光，总觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和之前的那些不一样？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.63,0:16:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……这道光，难道是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.07,0:16:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.93,0:17:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.70,0:17:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到这里来的话，已经没事了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.51,0:17:29.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放心吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.41,0:17:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特……我一定会保护你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.04,0:17:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.72,0:17:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.36,0:17:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是焦糖哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.51,0:17:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是能让人打起精神的魔法糖果。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.95,0:17:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吃吧，哈鲁特。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.13,0:18:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好甜。非常甜哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.74,0:18:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有精神了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.23,0:18:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.10,0:18:08.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦…　可是　哥哥大人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.30,0:18:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没事的…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要你能打起精神就好。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.34,0:18:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.69,0:18:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特一直和你在一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜　咕哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.06,0:18:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放开！　放开我！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.85,0:18:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.89,0:18:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来　回去吧　哈鲁特…　回心园去。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:47.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特！　哈鲁特！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.24,0:18:49.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（哈鲁特）哥哥　这次换我来…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.83,0:18:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.14,0:19:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特！！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.83,0:19:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马　哈鲁特一直在找的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.39,0:19:06.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是叫做焦糖的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.54,0:19:07.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}焦糖？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.85,0:19:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}焦糖　是什么意思啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.76,0:19:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕哈鲁特是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.82,0:19:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了把焦糖交给快斗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.35,0:19:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给快斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.15,0:19:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙啊 游马！ 这样下去{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.18,0:19:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会被哈鲁特的力量全部吞没。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.86,0:19:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.99,0:19:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！ 该怎么办才好啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.09,0:19:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特 你为什么要 拿什么焦糖啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.93,0:19:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.53,0:19:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 还带着焦糖吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.21,0:19:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}焦糖？ 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.28,0:19:49.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特… 哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.70,0:19:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看这个你一直在找的就是这个吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.73,0:19:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这块焦糖！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.43,0:20:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是想把这个交给快斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.91,0:20:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我来 我来把快斗…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.18,0:20:08.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见到快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.88,0:20:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以… 唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.17,0:20:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.41,0:20:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}晴人，你不是一个人你不是一个人啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥他，哥哥他是为了我才那么疲惫不堪。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.07,0:20:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以，所以我想让哥哥吃焦糖……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.35,0:20:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想让哥哥吃焦糖。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.47,0:20:43.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我看到了晴人的记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.56,0:20:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们两人从某个家伙手中逃了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.72,0:20:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被逼到了这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.56,0:20:50.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}面对不安悲伤的晴人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.56,0:20:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗把那东西递给他，给了他勇气。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.36,0:20:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}晴人一定是想对哥哥快斗做同样的事……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.75,0:20:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}晴人，你……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.12,0:21:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧，这群烦人的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.83,0:21:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对不会把晴人交给你们！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.49,0:21:17.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来的话就来啊……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.82,0:21:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你……你是谁！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.46,0:21:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}渴望得到晴人大人的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.70,0:21:38.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 快斗！你……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.73,0:21:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人也 看来同样在渴望着我。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.44,0:21:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们走吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.14,0:21:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 给我等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.99,0:21:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的使命是 摧毁星光体世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.90,0:21:56.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让你发出惨叫声吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.74,0:22:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！快斗！！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.34,0:22:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗 你 到底是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.56,0:24:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗那家伙还真是相当担心快斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.44,0:24:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过想想看这就是所谓的疼爱弟弟吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.13,0:24:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是所谓的兄弟爱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.22,0:24:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～ 我也好想要个兄弟啊～。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.62,0:24:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你有的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.86,0:24:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《确实如此》

